{
  "name": "LEARNING - Generate Course",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "webhook-generate-course",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "learning-generate-course",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "learning-generate-course",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "validate-input",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Handle both direct body and nested body.body (plugin compatibility)\nconst rawBody = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nconst body = rawBody.body || rawBody;\n\nconst required = ['prompt', 'topic', 'guild_id', 'instructor_id'];\nconst missing = required.filter(field => !body[field]);\n\nif (missing.length > 0) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      valid: false,\n      error: {\n        code: 400,\n        message: `Missing required parameters: ${missing.join(', ')}`,\n        status: 'BAD_REQUEST',\n        received_fields: Object.keys(body)\n      }\n    }\n  };\n}\n\n// Pass normalized body for downstream nodes\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    valid: true,\n    body: body\n  }\n};"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check-validation",
      "name": "Validation OK?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "error-missing-params",
      "name": "Error: Missing Params",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"success\": false, \"error\": $('Validate Input').first().json.error } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-course-llm",
      "name": "Generate Course Structure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"{{ $('Validate Input').first().json.body.model || 'claude-3-haiku-20240307' }}\",\n  \"max_tokens\": {{ $('Validate Input').first().json.body.max_tokens || 4096 }},\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"{{ $('Validate Input').first().json.body.prompt }}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-llm-response",
      "name": "Parse LLM Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $('Validate Input').first().json.body;\nconst llmResponse = $input.first().json;\n\ntry {\n  // Extract content from Claude response\n  const content = llmResponse.content?.[0]?.text || '';\n  \n  // Find JSON in the response (might be wrapped in markdown code blocks)\n  let jsonStr = content;\n  const jsonMatch = content.match(/```json\\n?([\\s\\S]*?)\\n?```/);\n  if (jsonMatch) {\n    jsonStr = jsonMatch[1];\n  }\n  \n  const courseData = JSON.parse(jsonStr);\n  \n  // Add metadata from validated body\n  const enrichedCourse = {\n    ...courseData,\n    instructor_id: body.instructor_id,\n    price_credits: body.price_credits || 0,\n    is_free: body.is_free !== false,\n    language: body.language || 'fr',\n    thumbnail_url: body.thumbnail_url || null\n  };\n  \n  return {\n    json: {\n      success: true,\n      course: enrichedCourse,\n      guild_id: body.guild_id\n    }\n  };\n} catch (e) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      success: false,\n      error: {\n        code: 500,\n        message: 'Failed to parse course structure: ' + e.message,\n        raw_response: llmResponse.content?.[0]?.text?.substring(0, 500)\n      }\n    }\n  };\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check-parse-success",
      "name": "Parse Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1140,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "save-course-api",
      "name": "Save Course Draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.API_URL }}/api/v1/courses/draft",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "guild_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.guild_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.course) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "format-success-response",
      "name": "Format Success Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1580,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const apiResponse = $input.first().json;\nconst parseData = $('Parse LLM Response').first().json;\nconst body = $('Validate Input').first().json.body;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    success: true,\n    data: {\n      course_id: apiResponse.id,\n      title: apiResponse.title,\n      status: apiResponse.status,\n      modules_count: apiResponse.modules_count || parseData.course.modules?.length || 0,\n      total_duration_minutes: apiResponse.total_duration_minutes\n    },\n    meta: {\n      workflow: 'learning-generate-course',\n      provider: 'anthropic',\n      model: body.model || 'claude-3-haiku-20240307',\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  }\n};"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "respond-success",
      "name": "Respond Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1800,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "respond-parse-error",
      "name": "Respond Parse Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1360,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"success\": false, \"error\": $json.error, \"meta\": { \"workflow\": \"learning-generate-course\", \"timestamp\": new Date().toISOString() } } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 500
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-note-doc",
      "name": "API Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 650,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## LEARNING - Generate Course (RFC-022)\n\n**Description:** Génère la structure d'un cours avec modules et leçons via LLM\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/learning-generate-course\n\n**InputSchema:**\n```json\n{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"topic\"],\"properties\":{\"topic\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Sujet du cours (ex: cuisine italienne, pâtisserie)\"},\"level\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"débutant\",\"intermédiaire\",\"avancé\"],\"description\":\"Niveau de difficulté\"},\"language\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"default\":\"fr\",\"description\":\"Langue du cours\"}}}\n```\n\n**Injected by plugin:** prompt, guild_id, instructor_id, model, max_tokens\n\n**Returns:** Course draft with generated structure"
      }
    }
  ],
